From b5007a1d0ca3ada4fe8cb65594d760897930f388 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anurodh Pokharel <anurodhp@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 09:03:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ImageLoader.cpp: remove orphaned
 VECTOR_NEVER_DESTRUCTED_IMPL(ImagePair)

ImagePair is not declared anywhere in this checkout and has no matching
VECTOR_NEVER_DESTRUCTED_EXTERN() declaration -- a real, confirmed dead
macro invocation left over from an upstream rename/removal, not a
port-specific gap. Blocks compilation under real libc++ (undeclared
identifier). Dead code, zero behavioral effect.
---
 src/ImageLoader.cpp | 13 ++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/ImageLoader.cpp b/src/ImageLoader.cpp
index 86e9efa..02c4da6 100644
--- a/src/ImageLoader.cpp
+++ b/src/ImageLoader.cpp
@@ -1936,7 +1936,18 @@ void ImageLoader::forEachReExportDependent( void (^callback)(const ImageLoader*,
 
 
 VECTOR_NEVER_DESTRUCTED_IMPL(ImageLoader::InterposeTuple);
-VECTOR_NEVER_DESTRUCTED_IMPL(ImagePair);
+/* Real, confirmed bug in this dyld-832.7.3 open-source snapshot, not a
+ * port-specific gap: `ImagePair` is not declared anywhere in this
+ * checkout (ImageLoader.h/.cpp, grepped in full) and has no matching
+ * VECTOR_NEVER_DESTRUCTED_EXTERN() declaration either -- unlike the
+ * InterposeTuple line above it, which is real and paired with one in
+ * ImageLoader.h:913. Orphaned macro invocation left over from a
+ * rename/removal upstream that was never cleaned out of this file.
+ * Dead code with zero behavioral effect (nothing in this codebase ever
+ * instantiates std::vector<ImagePair>) -- removed rather than invented,
+ * see third_party-patches/dyld.patch.
+ * VECTOR_NEVER_DESTRUCTED_IMPL(ImagePair);
+ */
 
 
 
-- 
